title: "DTCR: reproducibility deposit for a digital-twin-enabled cyber-resilience framework"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline, configuration, attack recipes and reference dataset for the
  digital-twin-enabled cyber-resilience framework for secure edge-cloud
  orchestration and data integrity. The release contains the reference
  implementation of the trust, audit, anomaly, dependency-risk, orchestration and
  resilience models, the statistical analysis that produces every reported effect,
  and the scripts that regenerate every figure. The data directory of this release
  contains a synthetic reference dataset; see PROVENANCE.md.
